"""OSV database snapshot pins. Generated by tools/snapshot_db.sh: do not
edit DB_SNAPSHOTS or DEFAULT_DB_DATE by hand.

Upstream publishes one zip of OSV records per ecosystem at a mutable URL,
https://osv-vulnerabilities.storage.googleapis.com/<Ecosystem>/all.zip,
rebuilt daily, so a sha256 pin on it breaks within a day. rules_osv pins
copies uploaded as assets of its own releases, one release per snapshot:

    https://github.com/collider-bazel-extensions/rules_osv/releases/download/db-<date>/<Ecosystem>-all.zip

Schema:

    DB_SNAPSHOTS = {
        "<YYYY-MM-DD>": {
            "<Ecosystem>": {"sha256": "<sha256 of the zip>", "size": <bytes>},
        },
    }

Maintainer flow:

    tools/snapshot_db.sh            # download today's zips, pin them, print the upload command
    gh release create db-<date> ... # the printed command

//tests:db_snapshots_test fails on an empty or malformed pin.
"""

